Cell["\<\
A branched fibration over the 4 \[Times] 4 grid, each fiber in its own \
colour: one vertex over one colour class of the grid, an edge over the other:\
\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"168c4138-4047-42a9-96a0-1dec689f64df"],

